"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/DDO_Store\" title=\"DDO Store\">DDO Store</a></b>, Seasonal Items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>10 charges of chocolate selections. You can use the following effects:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Dark Chocolate 'Magma' Truffle (Lasting <a href=\"/page/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a>, 3 minutes)</li>\n<li>Nut-hull Toffee Surprise (Lasting <a href=\"/page/Stoneskin\" title=\"Stoneskin\">Stoneskin</a>, CL 10, 10 minutes)</li>\n<li>Choco-Bacon-Berry Dream Bar (Lasting <a href=\"/page/Bear%27s_Endurance\" title=\"Bear&#39;s Endurance\">Bear's Endurance</a> and Lasting <a href=\"/page/Item:Long_Lasting_Elixir#Long_Lasting_Elixir_of_Bear&#39;s_Stamina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Long Lasting Elixir\">Bear's Stamina</a>, 1 hour)</li>\n<li>Glacial Mint Bon Bon (<a href=\"/page/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\">Cone of Cold</a>, CL 10)</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Enchanted_Chocolates.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Enchanted_Chocolates.png/420px-Enchanted_Chocolates.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"475\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Enchanted_Chocolates.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This small decorative box contains four types of delicious chocolate candies. Each type not only has its own unique flavor but also conveys a helpful enchantment.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li><b>Bug: </b> Cone of Cold part does not seem to deal any damage.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817000202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.119 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19004/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4801/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n136.02%  143.672     39 Template:IO\n100.00%  105.627      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  105.627      1 -total\n 96.99%  102.448      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 45.86%   48.445      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.05%   47.584      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 44.23%   46.714      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 43.07%   45.495      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.40%   22.606      1 Template:Mat\n 16.48%   17.407      2 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:34150-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817000202 and revision id 629788. Rendering was tr